# No runtime service-token environment variables or env file are required.
# Operators manage policies manually in the KV namespace bound as ServiceCatalog.
# Each credentials/<digest> key uses lowercase SHA-256 of the exact raw token's
# UTF-8 bytes (no trimming or newline). The value contains policy, never the token.
# Generate independent private 256-bit tokens with: openssl rand -hex 32
# No per-caller secret bindings, env overrides, or caller manifest are supported.
# canary.deploy.json owns nonsecret infrastructure configuration only.
# Copy canary.deploy.example.json to canary.deploy.json and customize it locally.
# Deployment never seeds policies or verifiers.
